@meeting endingZekeSunday.stay
// SW6 (ending writer A), Zeke at the end of the day (ending spec, Sunday Day 35, 21:00; he finds you; arrow level 1
// to the shuttle bay): by the Tern's ramp, where he met you on Day 0. STAY version (end.stay). The close mirrors his
// first words to you ("Hello, {me}. I'm Zeke Torres. Welcome aboard.").
title: The Tern's ramp
from: Zeke Torres
gist: At the end of the day Zeke took you down to the Tern's ramp, where he met you, and welcomed you aboard again.
== lines
torres-zeke: Here. This spot. Stand there. No, a bit left. There.   [gesture]
torres-zeke > you: First night, you were the one on the ramp. Bag, big eyes. I was the one at the bottom, nervous.
torres-zeke: I've been thinking about it all day. Since the Captain said. You're staying.   [sigh]
torres-zeke: So your scarf carries on. It's going to be ridiculous now. Years of scarf.   [laugh]
? choice
* I couldn't leave coil three.   flavour:cheer
  torres-zeke: She knows. She ran beautifully all afternoon. Coincidence. Probably.   [laugh]
* Thank you for meeting me, that night.   flavour:share
  torres-zeke: Thank you for coming down the ramp. Plenty don't. Plenty go back up.   [nod]
torres-zeke > you: Right. Properly, then. Hello, {me}. I'm Zeke Torres. Welcome aboard.   [nod]
torres-zeke: Again. For good this time. Right, onward. Bed. Big week. Every week is.
